{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1793115241","published":"2026-10-28T18:34:56Z","modified":"2026-11-27T16:31:42.972765982Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-107814","CVE-2026-107821","CVE-2026-107823","CVE-2026-85746","CVE-2026-86047","CVE-2026-92262"],"summary":"mariadb: Fix of 6 CVEs","details":"- CVE-2026-86047: quote identifiers and values in SHOW CREATE TABLE/USER, SHOW\n  GRANTS, mariadb-dump, mariadb-show and mariadb-convert-table-format,\n  including DATA/INDEX DIRECTORY paths; table option names outside\n  [A-Za-z0-9_] are rejected even under IGNORE_BAD_TABLE_OPTIONS, and existing\n  tables with such options no longer open (ERROR 1911)\n- CVE-2026-92262: refuse #mysql50# names that mix up with table names in the\n  table cache and on disk\n- CVE-2026-107823: escape view definer user/host in frm files; views whose\n  stored definer contains a backslash no longer open (ERROR 1343) or get an\n  altered definer; re-create them\n- CVE-2026-107821: validate frm data when opening a table; tables with a\n  CHAR(205..255) CHARACTER SET filename column converted by earlier builds no\n  longer open (ERROR 1033)\n- CVE-2026-85746: fix heap buffer overflow in ST_AsText() for nested geometry\n  collections\n- CVE-2026-107814: do not use the data directory as the mysql user's home; new\n  accounts and sysusers.d use /; on upgrade an existing account's home is\n  switched to / unless the server is running (a warning is printed then)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"mariadb","ecosystem":"TuxCare:AlmaLinux:9.6","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/mariadb?distro=almalinux-9.6"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3:10.5.29-2.el9_6.tuxcare.els6"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/tuxcare9.6esu/CLSA-2026-1793115241.json"}},{"package":{"name":"mariadb-backup","ecosystem":"TuxCare:AlmaLinux:9.6","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/mariadb-backup?distro=almalinux-9.6"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"